Per-residue MM-GBSA decomposition of the 3HFM interface (episcaf v3, D2) -- see mmgbsa/README.md
&general
sys_name       = "3HFM",
startframe     = 1,
endframe       = 2000,
interval       = 100,
temperature    = 300.0,
/
&gb
igb            = 5,
saltcon        = 0.150,
/
&decomp
idecomp        = 1,
dec_verbose    = 0,
print_res      = "within 5.0",
/
